{"resource":{"id":"html5-pdf-notes","title":"HTML5 — PDF Notes","category":"Web Development","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"51 min","pages":97,"lastUpdated":"October 2026","tags":["Web Development","HTML","A11y"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621839673705-6617adf9e890?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"Chapter-wise printable HTML5 notes — semantic, forms, multimedia, SVG, Canvas, ARIA, metadata, SEO, responsive, validation, performance."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"intro","label":"Introduction"},{"id":"s1","label":"1. Ch 1 — Basics"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. Ch 2 — Semantic HTML"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Ch 3 — Forms"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Ch 4 — Multimedia"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Ch 5 — SVG & Canvas"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. Ch 6 — Accessibility"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Ch 7 — SEO & Metadata"},{"id":"s8","label":"8. Ch 8 — Responsive"},{"id":"s9","label":"9. Ch 9 — Validation"},{"id":"s10","label":"10. Ch 10 — Performance"},{"id":"practices","label":"Accessibility & Best Practices"},{"id":"mistakes","label":"Common Mistakes"},{"id":"tips","label":"Tips & Tricks"},{"id":"compare","label":"Comparison Table"},{"id":"flow","label":"HTML Structure & Flow"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQs"},{"id":"references","label":"Further Reading & References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"HTML5 — Complete Tutorial","tag":"Web Development","time":"60 min"},{"title":"HTML5 — Cheat Sheet","tag":"Web Development","time":"6 min"},{"title":"HTML5 — Interview Questions","tag":"Web Development","time":"43 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Understand the core concepts covered in HTML5 — PDF Notes.</li>\n          <li>Write semantic, accessible, SEO-friendly HTML5 markup.</li>\n          <li>Recognize best practices and avoid the most common mistakes.</li>\n          <li>Use the comparison tables and structure diagrams as quick references.</li>\n          <li>Answer FAQs confidently and continue further reading.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"intro\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Introduction</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Structured, downloadable-quality HTML5 notes for offline study and revision.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-sky-500/40 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Who this is for</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Developers, designers, and content authors building modern accessible web experiences.</div></div></div></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542831371-29b0f74f9713?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Semantic HTML5 landmarks give structure that both browsers and screen readers rely on.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Ch 1 — Basics</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Doctype, structure, tags.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;!-- Ch 1 — Basics — illustrative snippet --&gt;\n&lt;section aria-label=&quot;ch 1 — basics&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Ch 1 — Basics&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Apply the concepts covered above.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Ch 2 — Semantic HTML</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Landmarks, outline.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;!-- Ch 2 — Semantic HTML — illustrative snippet --&gt;\n&lt;section aria-label=&quot;ch 2 — semantic html&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Ch 2 — Semantic HTML&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Apply the concepts covered above.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Ch 3 — Forms</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Inputs, labels, validation.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;!-- Ch 3 — Forms — illustrative snippet --&gt;\n&lt;section aria-label=&quot;ch 3 — forms&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Ch 3 — Forms&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Apply the concepts covered above.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Ch 4 — Multimedia</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Video, audio, picture.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;!-- Ch 4 — Multimedia — illustrative snippet --&gt;\n&lt;section aria-label=&quot;ch 4 — multimedia&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Ch 4 — Multimedia&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Apply the concepts covered above.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Ch 5 — SVG &amp; Canvas</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Vector & raster graphics.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;!-- Ch 5 — SVG &amp; Canvas — illustrative snippet --&gt;\n&lt;section aria-label=&quot;ch 5 — svg &amp; canvas&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Ch 5 — SVG &amp; Canvas&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Apply the concepts covered above.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Ch 6 — Accessibility</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>ARIA, WCAG.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;!-- Ch 6 — Accessibility — illustrative snippet --&gt;\n&lt;section aria-label=&quot;ch 6 — accessibility&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Ch 6 — Accessibility&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Apply the concepts covered above.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Ch 7 — SEO &amp; Metadata</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>OG, JSON-LD.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;!-- Ch 7 — SEO &amp; Metadata — illustrative snippet --&gt;\n&lt;section aria-label=&quot;ch 7 — seo &amp; metadata&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Ch 7 — SEO &amp; Metadata&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Apply the concepts covered above.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Ch 8 — Responsive</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Viewport, srcset.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;!-- Ch 8 — Responsive — illustrative snippet --&gt;\n&lt;section aria-label=&quot;ch 8 — responsive&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Ch 8 — Responsive&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Apply the concepts covered above.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Ch 9 — Validation</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>W3C, HTML lint.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;!-- Ch 9 — Validation — illustrative snippet --&gt;\n&lt;section aria-label=&quot;ch 9 — validation&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Ch 9 — Validation&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Apply the concepts covered above.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s10\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Ch 10 — Performance</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>preload, lazy.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;!-- Ch 10 — Performance — illustrative snippet --&gt;\n&lt;section aria-label=&quot;ch 10 — performance&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;Ch 10 — Performance&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;Apply the concepts covered above.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n\n\n      <section id=\"practices\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Accessibility &amp; Best Practices</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Use semantic elements before reaching for <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;span&gt;</code>.</li>\n          <li>Every image needs a meaningful <code>alt</code> attribute (or <code>alt=\"\"</code> if decorative).</li>\n          <li>Associate every form control with a <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>.</li>\n          <li>Preserve a logical heading hierarchy — never skip levels for visual size.</li>\n          <li>Use ARIA only when native HTML cannot express the semantics.</li>\n          <li>Include <code>&lt;meta name=\"viewport\"&gt;</code>, <code>charset</code>, description, and OG tags.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mistakes\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Common Mistakes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Wrapping everything in <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> — losing semantic meaning.</li>\n          <li>Missing or purely decorative <code>alt</code> text.</li>\n          <li>Redundant ARIA roles on tags that already have them (<code>&lt;nav role=\"navigation\"&gt;</code>).</li>\n          <li>Skipping heading levels (h1 → h4) to match a design.</li>\n          <li>Placing block elements inside inline elements or misnesting tags.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"tips\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Tips &amp; Tricks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Use <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;summary&gt;</code> for zero-JS disclosure widgets.</li>\n          <li>Use the native <code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code> element for modals with focus trapping.</li>\n          <li>Emmet expansions in VS Code speed up scaffolding tenfold.</li>\n          <li>Run axe DevTools + Lighthouse before every commit.</li>\n          <li><code>loading=\"lazy\"</code> on offscreen images improves LCP for free.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"compare\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Comparison Table</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Choice</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Prefer When</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Avoid When</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">&lt;article&gt;</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Self-contained content</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Simple grouping</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">&lt;section&gt;</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Thematic grouping with heading</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Purely visual grouping</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">&lt;div&gt;</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Non-semantic wrapper</td><td class=\"border p-2\">A semantic tag exists</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">ARIA</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Native HTML cannot express it</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Semantic tag exists</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"flow\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">HTML Structure &amp; Flow</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Document flow: browser parses HTML → constructs DOM → merges with CSSOM → renders.\" />\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;head&gt;\n    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot; /&gt;\n    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&quot; /&gt;\n    &lt;title&gt;Page Title&lt;/title&gt;\n  &lt;/head&gt;\n  &lt;body&gt;\n    &lt;header&gt;&lt;nav&gt;...&lt;/nav&gt;&lt;/header&gt;\n    &lt;main&gt;\n      &lt;article&gt;\n        &lt;h1&gt;Heading&lt;/h1&gt;\n        &lt;p&gt;Content...&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;/article&gt;\n    &lt;/main&gt;\n    &lt;footer&gt;...&lt;/footer&gt;\n  &lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>HTML5 — PDF Notes equips you with the practical knowledge to write semantic, accessible, and SEO-friendly HTML5.</p>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Semantic HTML5 is accessibility and SEO for free.</li>\n          <li>Landmarks give assistive tech the navigation it needs.</li>\n          <li>Metadata is not optional — it defines discoverability.</li>\n          <li>Test with real assistive tech, not only automated tools.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Do I need to learn XHTML?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No — HTML5's living standard replaced XHTML. Follow HTML5 conventions.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>When should I use ARIA?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Only when native HTML cannot express the semantics — the \"no ARIA is better than bad ARIA\" rule.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is HTML alone enough for a job?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Almost never on its own. Pair it with CSS, JavaScript, and accessibility fundamentals for frontend roles.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Further Reading &amp; References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Educational content — verify APIs and attribute support against the latest HTML Living Standard, MDN, and WCAG guidelines.</p>\n      </div></section>"}